  unitName: Nyx
  unitId: 60073
  unitNumber: 363
  description: A high class demon of the night sometimes called the "Princess of
    the Night." She usually draws in members of other species with her pheromones
    before making them her slaves. Unlike the Succubus she isn't known for her betrayals,
    but once she decides on a partner she sticks with them until she's absorbed all
    their vitality. When absorbing partners with higher concentrations of vitality
    it is said that she then tries herself to strengthen others, though by doing
    so it's said that she possesses their bodies eternally.
  summonDesc: Kneel before me.<br>From today forward<br>you are my toy!
  fusionDesc: That was nice, but I sure<br>would like some more.<br>You know what
    to do, right?
  evoDesc: You're so wonderful!<br>What are you planning to do <br>with me now that
    I'm like this?
